# Python

Package lives under `src/personalclipboard`. Public functions and dataclasses are typed.

```python
# BAD — GPU / HTTP / clipboard on the PortAudio or Qt thread
def callback(in_data, frame_count, time_info, status):
    model.transcribe(in_data)
    return (in_data, pyaudio.paContinue)

# GOOD — callback copies into the ring buffer only
def callback(in_data, frame_count, time_info, status):
    ring.write(in_data)
    return (None, pyaudio.paContinue)
```

- Qt main thread: overlay, tray, enable switch, `QClipboard` only.
- ASR worker owns CUDA Faster-Whisper. LLM worker owns localhost Ollama HTTP.
- Do not `time.sleep` or block in the audio callback. Prefer queues/`threading.Event` between workers.
- Config defaults belong in `config.py` (model names, hop size, hotkey, Ollama host).
